    <string key="card.name">Nairobi Loop</string>
    <string key="card.text">KICC, Uhuru Park, Nyayo Stadium, giraffes in the National Park, Bomas, Upper Hill and Westlands. Keep left, dodge the matatus, mind the bumps.</string>
    <string key="card.alt">A matatu covered in bright art on Uhuru Highway, the KICC tower behind it</string>
