    <string key="page.eyebrow">Nairobi · Kenya</string>
    <string key="page.alt">Driving through Nairobi</string>
    <string key="page.blurb">Down Uhuru Highway from KICC, out past Wilson Airport and the National Park where giraffes graze by the road, round through Karen and back up past Upper Hill and Westlands. Kenya drives on the left.</string>
    <string key="page.T_MAPNOTE">The road roughly follows real places in Nairobi. Kenya drives on the left, so the slow lane is on the left. The horn makes the car ahead move over.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R1S">Pick a trip between Nairobi landmarks, from KICC to the National Park to Westlands, and reach the end.</string>
    <string key="page.T_R3S">Cameras flash above 90 km/h. Speed bumps and crashes damage the car.</string>
